msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadingScope|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Reading Scope"
msgstr "读取范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadingScope|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed enumeration of the exact source records offered to a selected refiner, with their declared assertion-time chronology frame. It asserts no completeness of the surrounding store."
msgstr "有归属的枚举，列出提供给所选细化器的确切来源记录及其声明的断言时间顺序框架。不声明周围存储的完整性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadingScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadingScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadingScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadingScope|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:scope a gmeow:ReadingScope ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:scope a gmeow:ReadingScope ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "scope record"
msgstr "范围记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source record offered within a reading scope, including a record later reported unreadable. Members retain their actual RDF identities, including blank nodes or triple terms when supplied."
msgstr "读取范围内提供的来源记录，包括后来报告无法读取的记录。成员保留其实际 RDF 身份，包括所提供的空白节点或三元组项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:scope gmeow:scopeRecord ex:record ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:scope gmeow:scopeRecord ex:record ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeChronology|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "scope chronology"
msgstr "范围时间顺序"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeChronology|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The temporal frame in which source assertion times are interpreted for this scope’s chronology. The selected reading must respect original precision and unresolved ties; this relation does not manufacture an order."
msgstr "解释此范围时间顺序中来源断言时间的时间框架。所选解读须尊重原始精度及未解决的并列；此关系不凭空产生顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeChronology|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeChronology|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeChronology|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scopeChronology|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:scope gmeow:scopeChronology gmeow:temporalFrameUTCGregorian ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:scope gmeow:scopeChronology gmeow:temporalFrameUTCGregorian ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readingScope|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reading scope"
msgstr "读取范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readingScope|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The explicit source-record scope of a finding or reading-limit aggregate. This relation does not turn its subject into an Observation or claim global source coverage."
msgstr "发现或读取限制汇总的显式来源记录范围。此关系不将其主体转为 Observation，也不声明全局来源覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readingScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readingScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readingScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readingScope|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:finding gmeow:readingScope ex:scope ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:finding gmeow:readingScope ex:scope ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FirstOccurrence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "First Occurrence"
msgstr "首次出现"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FirstOccurrence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A selected refiner’s reading of an earliest source record for one relation and referent among the records explicitly offered in its reading scope, under the declared source assertion-time chronology. It is not a global first or the subject’s assertion."
msgstr "所选细化器依据声明的来源断言时间顺序，在其读取范围中显式提供的记录内，对某关系与指称对象的最早来源记录之一所作的解读。不是全局首次，也不是主体的断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FirstOccurrence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FirstOccurrence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FirstOccurrence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FirstOccurrence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:first a gmeow:FirstOccurrence ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:first a gmeow:FirstOccurrence ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RelationOccasion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Relation Occasion"
msgstr "关系发生次"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RelationOccasion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A selected refiner’s reading of one occasion of a relation to a resource or source-named referent in its declared records-read scope. It records source evidence rather than an independent world event."
msgstr "所选细化器在其声明的已读记录范围内，对一次与资源或由来源命名的指称对象的关系发生所作的解读。记录来源证据，而非独立的现实事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RelationOccasion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RelationOccasion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RelationOccasion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RelationOccasion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:occasion a gmeow:RelationOccasion ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:occasion a gmeow:RelationOccasion ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relation predicate"
msgstr "关系谓词"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual predicate IRI by which the source records relate to the referent. It names the source relation without asserting a new edge or evaluating a query."
msgstr "来源记录与指称对象关联时使用的实际谓词 IRI。命名来源关系，不断言新边，也不执行查询。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationPredicate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationPredicate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:finding gmeow:relationPredicate gmeow:hasParticipant ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:finding gmeow:relationPredicate gmeow:hasParticipant ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationVault|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relation vault"
msgstr "关系存储"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationVault|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source store containing the records for this relation reading or reading-limit aggregate. Naming the store supplies neither access authority nor a claim that every store record was read."
msgstr "包含此关系解读或读取限制汇总所涉及记录的来源存储。命名存储不授予访问权限，也不声明已读取存储内全部记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationVault|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationVault|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:finding gmeow:relationVault ex:archive ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:finding gmeow:relationVault ex:archive ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedThing|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "related thing"
msgstr "关联事物"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedThing|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The referent identified by its actual IRI in the source relation. The IRI is retained without inferring identity from a name or minting a replacement for an unshareable source term."
msgstr "来源关系中以其实际 IRI 标识的指称对象。保留该 IRI，不从名称推断身份，也不为无法共享的来源项创建替代物。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedThing|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedThing|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedThing|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedThing|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:finding gmeow:relatedThing ex:person ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:finding gmeow:relatedThing ex:person ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedName|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "related name"
msgstr "关联名称"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact source-supplied name when a relation names its referent only by a literal. Language and base direction are retained when supplied; the name alone does not establish an IRI identity."
msgstr "关系仅以字面量命名其指称对象时，由来源提供的确切名称。保留所提供的语言及基方向；仅有名称不能确立 IRI 身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relatedName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:finding gmeow:relatedName \"Visitor\"@en ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:finding gmeow:relatedName \"Visitor\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationAt|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relation assertion time"
msgstr "关系断言时间"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationAt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original assertion-time value supplied by the source record, retained at its actual precision. It is neither the refiner’s observation clock nor the record’s transaction time; a date, month or year invents no instant or timezone."
msgstr "来源记录提供的原始断言时间值，按其实际精度保留。既非细化器的观察时钟，也非记录事务时间；日期、月份或年份不会凭空产生时刻或时区。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationAt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:finding gmeow:relationAt \"2026-10\"^^xsd:gYearMonth ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:finding gmeow:relationAt \"2026-10\"^^xsd:gYearMonth ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationIn|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relation source occasion"
msgstr "关系来源场合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationIn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source occasion or context in which the relation was found, such as a conversation. This is distinct from the refiner’s execution and from its derived RelationOccasion reading."
msgstr "发现该关系的来源场合或上下文，例如对话。区别于细化器执行及其派生的 RelationOccasion 解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
msgstr "用于保留显式限定范围且有归属的解读的这一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global completeness, source-subject endorsement or a successful computation from this record."
msgstr "避免从该记录推断全局完整性、来源主体认可或计算成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the original source identities, supplied precision and declaring vantage; do not replace missing evidence with defaults."
msgstr "保留原始来源身份、所提供精度及声明视角；不得以默认值替代缺失证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationIn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this scoped report: ex:finding gmeow:relationIn ex:conversation ."
msgstr "保留此限定范围报告：ex:finding gmeow:relationIn ex:conversation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingSummary|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "finding summary"
msgstr "发现摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingSummary|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A language-bearing one-line account of what the refiner found under its own vantage. The wording retains its language and any base direction and does not become the source subject’s claim."
msgstr "细化器在自身视角下对所发现内容的一行带语言说明。措辞保留语言及任何基方向，不会变成来源主体的主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/findingSummary|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain this part of an explicitly scoped, attributed reading."
